# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M6 Relax (the toolbar's Relax, Task 10's relax button): H2 at R = 1.6 Bohr relaxes with FIRE to
# the minimum of the sigma = h = 0.25 surface (about 1.79 Bohr; the sigma -> 0 LSDA minimum is
# 1.45, README "Physics, honestly"), the readout says it converged, and the run is left paused.
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
action preset h2
wait idle
action relax
wait idle
expect relaxed true
expect dist 0 1 1.75 1.83
expect paused true
expect no-error
